# Moffat Bay Marina - local MySQL connection settings
# Committed on purpose (see .gitignore's Environment note): each teammate
# still creates their OWN local database with
# Module-3/SQL/01_create_database.sql, but everyone uses this same
# name/username/password, so checking it in means the project runs right
# after a clone with no separate hand-off step.

